      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FIND THE SUN (2) has a strong record this trip with 12 wins and 12 placings from 31 starts. In the money last time at Geelong (22.57) in a Grade 4/5, finishing a 1.3 lengths second. Appeals as a leading chance in this. ASTON PLUTO (1) scored two back then well held latest finishing a 12 length 7th at Warrnambool (22.82). The form out of her last race has been franked. Has ability and can measure up. MISS MY BROTHER (3) is a talented type and proved too strong last time to win by 2 lengths at Ballarat in a handy 22.44 beating Whisky Point. Winner at his latest appearance in one of the quickest times on the card. Can go close again if runs up to latest figure. HYPNOTIZING (8) has a solid strike rate at this distance.",
